silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_01_functors_as_typed_cross_kg_mappings_sections_01_household_kg_as_source_category_concrete_anchor#mittens a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.20_functorial_transport.chapters.01_functors_as_typed_cross_kg_mappings.sections.01_household_kg_as_source_category.concrete_anchor#mittens" .
silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_01_functors_as_typed_cross_kg_mappings_sections_01_household_kg_as_source_category_concrete_anchor#mittens silm:hasLongDescription "The Mittens is the concrete household cat called Mittens, identified by microchip 9, owner-fed daily, subject of household vet record 77. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_01_functors_as_typed_cross_kg_mappings_sections_01_household_kg_as_source_category_concrete_anchor#bodymassquality_77 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.20_functorial_transport.chapters.01_functors_as_typed_cross_kg_mappings.sections.01_household_kg_as_source_category.concrete_anchor#bodymassquality_77" .
silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_01_functors_as_typed_cross_kg_mappings_sections_01_household_kg_as_source_category_concrete_anchor#bodymassquality_77 silm:hasLongDescription "The BodyMassQuality_77 is the household's record of Mittens' body-mass quality (scaled in kilograms, captured March 2026, log entry 77). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'BodyMassQuality_77', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_01_functors_as_typed_cross_kg_mappings_sections_01_household_kg_as_source_category_concrete_anchor#microchipid_9 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.20_functorial_transport.chapters.01_functors_as_typed_cross_kg_mappings.sections.01_household_kg_as_source_category.concrete_anchor#microchipid_9" .
silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_01_functors_as_typed_cross_kg_mappings_sections_01_household_kg_as_source_category_concrete_anchor#microchipid_9 silm:hasLongDescription "The MicrochipId_9 is Mittens' implanted microchip's serial identifier (a 9-digit string registered with the household vet). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'MicrochipId_9', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_01_functors_as_typed_cross_kg_mappings_sections_01_household_kg_as_source_category_concrete_anchor#housevetrecord_77 a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.20_functorial_transport.chapters.01_functors_as_typed_cross_kg_mappings.sections.01_household_kg_as_source_category.concrete_anchor#housevetrecord_77" .
silm:instances_papers_20_functorial_transport_chapters_01_functors_as_typed_cross_kg_mappings_sections_01_household_kg_as_source_category_concrete_anchor#housevetrecord_77 silm:hasLongDescription "The HouseVetRecord_77 is the household-side aggregate vet record numbered 77, kept in the family's filing cabinet, that ties the body-mass measurement to the microchip registration. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'HouseVetRecord_77', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
